  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Competitiveness of Business in Local Production Systems in So Paulo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Competitividad Sistemas Productivos Locales So Paulo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general (fin) del Programa es fomentar la competitividad de la economa del Estado de San Pablo. El objetivo especfico (propsito) es articular diversos instrumentos de apoyo empresarial para la promocin de prcticas competitivas y sustentables en las empresas de los APLs atendidos por el Programa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to contribute to economic growth (sales, employment) of productive sectors located specially in the state of So Paulo. The specific objective is to strengthen PyMEs cooperation and joined actions within APLs and stimulate them, through sample initiatives, towards innovation, technological development and international markets access.</narrative>
  </description>
